<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes in Colombia have killed three soldiers and wounded eight, while armed men murdered three women in Toro, showing a rise in direct violence. A powerful earthquake has increased the death toll, and the Ombudsman condemned images of De la Espriella brandishing a gun, reflecting heightened political tension. The United States has launched strikes on Venezuelan soil, and the UN has withdrawn oversight of a key rural peace chapter, indicating reduced international monitoring. The war crimes tribunal JEP announced steep measures after a $53 million budget cut, and 225 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxQUTA3MU5RT3RIaUg0b2lvWXpQbm41MDhCLVZKWDlscmJWRzBKdTktVFBzNjBDcEZROG9mZ0pmLWVEZWJ2NEZZb1N4alpOYkZDOURiS25KbUwzdUhob202NE05ajhjb1hYWHdTZlBLUTRkb2lGZERqdHllTTJjZEk5c3I5TDRuRWhRSEliMXdBNm5sNVhZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVkQyTU5QLS1RV0N3SU1iekhjb2pIbmpEOGJOZUZYaFA2di1zVXdQa0RHNjRmODhJYWRPSVFfWlZXNmFvM2F1YVdydHNzaWZQRHVjOUJDTkt2VHhSQXgwNkdYdlZQVXlpWTJCNVRyZG1hLWdEdG9zdllaLS0zX0Z1UHhnaTF4TzY2Tkt3N1NlNkZvTjQyYk9zZl9OY1VWVmc1bFY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE8wOU82YkthNktDZFduT2loZG9iTlJJUzR4VkdhQ1dTVGZ4Y2JFeXljTFhKTlpWUU5MaS1maWh0VkJCQXJ0ZjRrcXdvcnlPS1N6dldOZFphSENyZ2UzWFVtcUVNOExnbkdPd2JBZXVyZlIzTV9wRU9BakM1LTBiTVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE9BLURPaFlLdWhFd05rcUp4WmJnYzlULWswT2RHMVVxZnJRekpBRi1kWEF2Wi1zYXI0bG5Bel9Ob1J2VzRjM1JjYklCb19IaXFsMV8ybDlLdzlzck05WFVxWHFEMDVvdDNFMFdWLXJRSzNQbnZsb0oyVTMwb1A?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href